{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0019547:arginine catabolic process to ornithine\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29601\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here:  https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1EVVgQuSEQ3A27TfNyutgqARakgNvJQG1kTEUo-0lO5c/edit?usp=sharing\n\nImpacted groups: \nCGD 1\n~PomBase 2~. DONE\nRGD 3\nSGD 2 (Automatic replace by \"urea cycle\" ([GO:0000050](https://www.pombase.org/term/GO:0000050))\n~UniProt 5~ DONE\n\n\nNo Mappings that need to be reviewed.\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-03-11T18:36:41Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0019547:arginine catabolic process to ornithine", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-03-21T22:41:54Z"}
